{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ2vvM1AJTv2cu32nvuu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't find Airbnb's (ABNB) share counts by class with these tools.\n\nClass A: Not found with these tools\nClass B: Not found with these tools\n\nThe figures should be on the cover page of Airbnb's 10-Q for the quarter ended 31 March 2025, filed 1 May 2025. That is the latest periodic filing on or before 16 May 2025. Here is why I couldn't get the numbers:\n- **Cover-page data isn't there:** The cover-page field that holds the shares-outstanding count isn't available for ABNB in these tools. Only its public float figure comes back.\n- **No balance-sheet data either:** The two balance-sheet fields for shares outstanding also returned nothing for ABNB.\n- **Text search found the filing but not the numbers:** It shows which filings mention Class A and Class B shares outstanding, but not the text of the passage. Searching for the exact cover-page wording returned no hits.\n\nTo get the numbers, open the cover page of the 10-Q at the link below. It gives the Class A and Class B counts as of a date in late April 2025.\n\nSources\n- Form 10-Q (period ended 31 Mar 2025), filed 2025-05-01, accession 0001559720-25-000017: https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1559720/000155972025000017/abnb-20250331.htm\n- Form 10-K (FY2024), filed 2025-02-13, accession 0001559720-25-000010"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":218,"cache_read_input_tokens":8608,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":218},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53ddb2db-0759-4c02-898c-870485084a8f","uuid":"1a60acd3-8fa4-456b-bd17-668a05614895","timest